' Building through the reference interface: reloading a rifle.
'
' The one recipe every class may do, so it needs nobody hired. Run it with
' `give item_unloaded_rifle,item_ammunition`, which puts the two parts in the
' pack's last two slots.
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 10
mapclick 309,168         ' the first room
wait 5
uiclick r168,248         ' right-click the unloaded rifle, pack slot 4
wait 5
snap build_asked         ' 512 section 3, with the Yes line
uiclick 169,206          ' "OK, make me loaded rifle."
wait 5
snap build_done          ' the loaded rifle in slot 4, slot 5 emptied
